{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Climb your way to madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your quest in a climbing game with roguelike elements and a cosmic horror style. Swing and launch yourself through ever-changing levels while obtaining Eyes, a mysterious currency that will alter the horrors perceived and the challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use Cool Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items are a big part of the game. Get them by looting corpses or buying them from the shop. Equip an item in each hand and find your favorite combo, but remember! You can't use an item if it's in the same hand you're holding on from. Passive items will offer respite and help you navigate levels as well. Aid your climb with these boons or curses\u2026 For better and for worse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gain eyes to uncover horrors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with the devious Mountain to deepen your knowledge of its secrets. Each level, enemy, and mechanic has 3 variations; the more Eyes you have, the harder the climb and the creepier the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_4.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the mountain, you might notice peculiar things like puzzles are hidden in every area. By solving them, you'll navigate memories, where you'll learn more about your character, the mountain and the cults that have spawned around it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can you hear the Calling?</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2645670?t=1749447501","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749447501","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/9592ebdc4d267888c6125e87db7a8d74c11303f2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749447501","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/9592ebdc4d267888c6125e87db7a8d74c11303f2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749447501","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2990590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_1.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Climb your way to madness</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your quest in a climbing game with roguelike elements and a cosmic horror style. Swing and launch yourself through ever-changing levels while obtaining Eyes, a mysterious currency that will alter the horrors perceived and the challenges. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_2.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use Cool Items</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items are a big part of the game. Get them by looting corpses or buying them from the shop. Equip an item in each hand and find your favorite combo, but remember! You can't use an item if it's in the same hand you're holding on from. Passive items will offer respite and help you navigate levels as well. Aid your climb with these boons or curses\u2026 For better and for worse!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_3.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gain eyes to uncover horrors</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with the devious Mountain to deepen your knowledge of its secrets. Each level, enemy, and mechanic has 3 variations; the more Eyes you have, the harder the climb and the creepier the vibe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/extras/gif_4.gif?t=1749447501\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you explore the mountain, you might notice peculiar things like puzzles are hidden in every area. By solving them, you'll navigate memories, where you'll learn more about your character, the mountain and the cults that have spawned around it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Can you hear the Calling?</h2>","developers":["Covert Wonders"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2645670/header.jpg?t=1749447501","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS Ventura<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple M1 or Intel Core M</l